<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 7.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 7.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     16.29    4.91</p>
<p> 2   Bk of Queen	    13.78    5.88</p>
<p> 3   Mt Leyshon Gold	11.79    2.12</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	 9.51    1.03</p>
<p> 5   BT Prop Trust	   9.27    1.76</p>
<p> 6   Aust Tour		 9.26    0.81</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 9.08    1.11</p>
<p> 8   Centro Prop	     8.90    2.19</p>
<p> 9   Ipoh			8.74    2.06</p>
<p>10   Colonial Mutual	 8.57    1.20</p>
<p>11   Indu Property	   8.51    1.01</p>
<p>12   Villa World	     8.40    1.19</p>
<p>13   Burswood Prop	   8.39    1.43</p>
<p>14   Equitilink		8.33    0.60</p>
<p>15   Gandel Retail Tr	8.31    0.94</p>
<p>16   Natl In Prop	    8.20    1.07</p>
<p>17   Countrywide-PP	  8.19    1.24</p>
<p>18   Hills Inds		8.14    2.10</p>
<p>19   Colonial Coml	   8.03    2.27</p>
<p>20   Westfield Trust	 8.03    2.44</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
